        "original_id": "fd46c962-c057-5716-b345-0d74353716f6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: San Diego, Downtown San Diego, California, United States, Las Vegas Valley, Nevada\n- Organizations: U.S. Coast Guard\n- Products: San Diego International Airport, McCarran International Airport, Coast Guard Air Station San Diego\n- People: Chelsea Chen\n- Concepts: IATA, ICAO, FAA LID\n\nFacts:\n- Chelsea Chen was born on December 30, 1983, in San Diego, California.\n- Chelsea Chen is an American organist and composer.\n- San Diego International Airport was formerly known as Lindbergh Field.\n- San Diego International Airport has the codes IATA SAN, ICAO KSAN, and FAA LID SAN.\n- San Diego International Airport is an international airport 3 miles northwest of Downtown San Diego, California, United States.\n- McCarran International Airport has the codes IATA LAS, ICAO KLAS, and FAA LID LAS.\n- McCarran International Airport is the primary commercial airport serving the Las Vegas Valley in Nevada.\n- U.S. Coast Guard Air Station San Diego is a Coast Guard Air Station based in San Diego, California, United States.\n- U.S. Coast Guard Air Station San Diego is across the street from San Diego International Airport.",
